[Desktop Entry]
Type=Application
Name=Mouse Remapper
GenericName=Mouse Macros
GenericName[pt]=Macros do mouse
Comment=Create keyboard macros on your mouse buttons
Comment[pt]=Crie macros de teclado nos botões do mouse
